    <string name="frost_ref_title">Reference date of the last frost</string>
    <string name="frost_ref_tropical_text">In the French overseas territories there is no frost: the calendar starts from the beginning of the planting season in your territory. This date is an estimate that varies by 1 to 2 months depending on the source and the microclimate: adjust it to the day. All tasks and sowing reminders are calculated from this day.</string>
    <string name="frost_ref_temperate_text">In mainland France, the median date falls between mid-March (Mediterranean zone) and mid-May (Ice Saints in lowland / mountain areas). All tasks and sowing reminders are calculated from this reference day.</string>
